things are easier for us.

648
00:27:26,710 --> 00:27:29,320
That can't be called a bond.

649
00:27:29,320 --> 00:27:32,020
They're trying to gather
as much information as possible.

650
00:27:32,020 --> 00:27:34,390
- They need to share information.
- They're really confused right now.

651
00:27:34,390 --> 00:27:37,320
We discussed for a few hours
after getting the announcement.

652
00:27:37,320 --> 00:27:38,930
- They're doing the same?
- They're talking about the benefits...

653
00:27:38,930 --> 00:27:40,790
- and how things work.
- They're making calculations.

654
00:27:40,790 --> 00:27:42,560
They need time to discuss
about these things.

655
00:27:42,560 --> 00:27:45,200
"This is bad for this team
when this happens..."

656
00:27:45,200 --> 00:27:46,430
"and this must happen."

657
00:27:46,430 --> 00:27:48,640
These are the things they're discussing.

658
00:27:49,270 --> 00:27:51,540
- It looks great.
- Gosh.

659
00:27:52,070 --> 00:27:54,310
Why are there so many seats?

660
00:27:54,910 --> 00:27:57,310
- The five of us have to sit.
- Right.

661
00:27:57,310 --> 00:28:00,050
- This is where the negotiations happen.
- The negotiation table.

662
00:28:00,150 --> 00:28:02,180
We must be calling over
one team at a time.

663
00:28:02,180 --> 00:28:03,250
It's...

664
00:28:04,520 --> 00:28:06,250
- Sit in the middle.
- Sit in the middle.

665
00:28:06,250 --> 00:28:07,550
- What is this?
- Right.

666
00:28:09,020 --> 00:28:12,030
I think I should be in the back.

667
00:28:12,030 --> 00:28:13,690
- Right. You should switch seats.
- Okay.

668
00:28:14,390 --> 00:28:17,060
(Ugong checks the inside of the center.)

669
00:28:17,430 --> 00:28:18,900
Then we must...

670
00:28:18,900 --> 00:28:20,770
- decide on this.
- They're placed here.

671
00:28:20,900 --> 00:28:22,970
As she's a spy from Team White,

672
00:28:22,970 --> 00:28:24,600
I think it will be good for her...

673
00:28:24,600 --> 00:28:25,970
to reveal how many Team White issued.

674
00:28:26,110 --> 00:28:27,170
- To them?
- Yes.

675
00:28:27,170 --> 00:28:28,170
Right.

676
00:28:28,170 --> 00:28:29,180
- After that...
- You can reveal it, right?

677
00:28:29,180 --> 00:28:31,540
- It's fine.
- And we're not sure...

678
00:28:31,540 --> 00:28:34,910
how much more will be issued
with Black's skill.

679
00:28:35,110 --> 00:28:38,250
But this is what I'm worried about.

680
00:28:38,520 --> 00:28:39,920
The limit is 200.

681
00:28:39,920 --> 00:28:42,290
If the skill does not get developed,

682
00:28:42,290 --> 00:28:44,890
their resources will become clear as well.

683
00:28:45,020 --> 00:28:47,790
The accountant of Team Red...

684
00:28:47,990 --> 00:28:49,900
- made the calculations.
- He made the calculations.

685
00:28:49,900 --> 00:28:52,200
- They don't have many diamonds.
- Right.

686
00:28:52,200 --> 00:28:53,530
Toward the end,

687
00:28:53,530 --> 00:28:55,640
they said, "We must survive first."

688
00:28:55,640 --> 00:28:57,470
- They're short on lives.
- Right.

689
00:28:57,470 --> 00:28:58,570
So we should...

690
00:28:58,770 --> 00:28:59,910
"We'll make you live..."

691
00:28:59,910 --> 00:29:01,910
- "and let you take you a lot."
- Right.

692
00:29:01,910 --> 00:29:04,340
- We're distributing it fairly.
- Right.

693
00:29:04,340 --> 00:29:05,780
- We're not being greedy.
- Right.

694
00:29:05,980 --> 00:29:08,080
People must hate Team White.

695
00:29:08,080 --> 00:29:10,750
They cut down the prize money
from 200,000 dollars to 100,000 dollars.

696
00:29:11,950 --> 00:29:13,590
Well, I suppose so.

697
00:29:14,390 --> 00:29:17,590
But when you go through survival
starting from Day One,

698
00:29:17,790 --> 00:29:20,690
- It's understandable?
- it's hard to focus on the prize money.

699
00:29:20,690 --> 00:29:21,690
- Survival.
- Right.

700
00:29:21,690 --> 00:29:24,030
- Survival is a greater priority.
- Survival is a greater priority.

701
00:29:24,760 --> 00:29:27,200
We have a few more lives.

702
00:29:27,430 --> 00:29:31,300
I believe we can persuade
Team Red with that.

703
00:29:31,470 --> 00:29:34,040
We must start causing cracks...

704
00:29:34,340 --> 00:29:38,340
to bring change to this current structure.

705
00:29:38,540 --> 00:29:41,380
Team Red is in a strange position.

706
00:29:41,380 --> 00:29:43,180
Lives are precious,

707
00:29:43,180 --> 00:29:44,550
and there aren't many diamonds.

708
00:29:44,550 --> 00:29:46,690
We're going to try to team up
with Team Red and Team Blue.

709
00:29:46,690 --> 00:29:47,920
With Team White,

710
00:29:47,920 --> 00:29:50,620
we will try to avoid going to war.

711
00:29:51,620 --> 00:29:53,030
This is our advantage.

712
00:29:53,030 --> 00:29:55,600
- We have a lot more lives.
- Right.

713
00:29:55,600 --> 00:29:57,900
Since I'm a diamond-based team,

714
00:29:58,500 --> 00:30:00,430
I will not trade lives with them.

715
00:30:00,430 --> 00:30:02,540
I will use the lives only for you.

716
00:30:02,900 --> 00:30:06,040
We can be in the upper hand with lives.

717
00:30:06,170 --> 00:30:08,840
The advantage of gold...

718
00:30:09,040 --> 00:30:10,580
- is that it's revealed to everyone.
- Right.

719
00:30:10,580 --> 00:30:12,910
- We can do that with diamonds as well.
- Right.

720
00:30:12,910 --> 00:30:16,250
My only strength is in information,
and I can share that with you.

721
00:30:16,550 --> 00:30:19,390
The credit team seems to be
in a shaky position.

722
00:30:19,450 --> 00:30:22,420
It would be great if Team White
could share a bit of...

723
00:30:22,420 --> 00:30:25,090
- the new resource to Team Red.
- Right.

724
00:30:25,090 --> 00:30:26,790
- Right. We are planning to do that.
- Right.

725
00:30:26,790 --> 00:30:27,790
- Totally.
- Right.

726
00:30:27,790 --> 00:30:31,100
I will give up on profits
for the diamond team.

727
00:30:35,400 --> 00:30:36,970
I must do that...

728
00:30:37,370 --> 00:30:39,170
in order to take away
even a small amount of prize money.

729
00:30:39,410 --> 00:30:41,910
I won't be able to get any gold otherwise.

730
00:30:42,110 --> 00:30:43,710
I'm saying this...

731
00:30:43,710 --> 00:30:45,580
because it's 0 or 1,000 dollars for me.

732
00:30:47,680 --> 00:30:50,720
After Team Gold appeared,
Vector tried to persuade us.

733
00:30:51,020 --> 00:30:53,920
"The only weakness of diamonds
is that it isn't transparent."

734
00:30:54,190 --> 00:30:57,120
"I will make it transparent as Black."

735
00:30:57,120 --> 00:30:58,930
"So join me."

736
00:30:58,930 --> 00:31:02,300
He promised to give us more resources,

737
00:31:02,400 --> 00:31:05,260
and the carrot was dangled in front of us.

738
00:31:05,360 --> 00:31:08,070
Black was never like this.

739
00:31:08,070 --> 00:31:09,540
He was rational...

740
00:31:09,540 --> 00:31:12,100
and made cool-headed decisions.

741
00:31:12,370 --> 00:31:15,470
He was someone who kept
making these plays.

742
00:31:15,710 --> 00:31:19,280
But as soon as Team Gold appeared,

743
00:31:19,280 --> 00:31:21,780
